# Date Format

Always use

```
YYYY-MM-DD
```

Example

```
2026-07-27
```

---

# Currency

All amounts are stored as numbers.

Example

```
25.50
```

Currency symbols (£, $, €, etc.) are only displayed to the user and are not stored.


